== story
Warm morning light falls across the path to the customer’s home as she approaches the front door, carrying the same bouquet she received at Petal & Stem. Her dark brown hair remains swept into a low, loosely twisted bun, and she wears her small gold-colored earring and light gray-green collared jacket with large patch pockets. The colorful flowers rest in their overlapping pale gray and beige paper, their long green stems exposed below. Her partner, a man with short grey-flecked hair and a navy sweater, greets her at the doorway. She smiles and holds the bouquet out to him. He responds with a warm smile and takes it gently, supporting the wrapped stems as she releases her hold. She stays beside him at the threshold. The moment ends with the two of them together in the morning light, the unchanged bouquet held between them, conveying an affectionate, everyday welcome home.
